@startuml
title US-004 - Register resource - SD level 3 - Frontend
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Admin or Staff" as Staff
participant "ResourcesPage" as View
participant "RegisterResourceForm" as Component
participant "resourcesService" as Service
participant "HttpClient" as Http
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over View, API
  The organization comes from the caller's session.
  RegisterResourceForm is a modal dialog opened by the
  page's button or by the dashboard shortcut (?new=1).
end note

Staff -> View: Open the register dialog
activate View
View -> Component: Mount (dialog.showModal)
activate Component
Component -> Service: listTypes()
activate Service
Service -> Http: GET /resource-types
activate Http
Http -> API: HTTP request (session cookie)
activate API
API --> Http: 200 (system and organization types)
deactivate API
Http --> Service: ResourceType[]
deactivate Http
Service --> Component: ResourceType[]
deactivate Service
Component --> View: Dialog with name, type, description
deactivate Component
View --> Staff: Show the dialog
deactivate View

Staff -> View: Submit name, type, and description
activate View
View -> Component: onSubmit(name, typeId, description)
activate Component
alt Name or type missing
    Component --> View: Field errors (no request)
else Details present
    Component -> Service: register(name, typeId, description)
    activate Service
    Service -> Http: POST /resources (RegisterResourceDto)
    activate Http
    Http -> API: HTTP request (session cookie and anti-forgery header)
    activate API
    alt Request accepted
        API --> Http: 201 Created (ResourceDto)
    else Request rejected
        API --> Http: 400/403/409/500
    end
    deactivate API
    Http --> Service: Response data or rejected request
    deactivate Http
    Service --> Component: ResourceDto, or thrown error
    deactivate Service
    alt Successful response
        Component --> View: onRegistered(resource); dialog closes
    else Failed response
        Component --> View: Field errors or message (validation / authorization / limit / operation)
    end
end
deactivate Component
View --> Staff: Render the success notice or the dialog's errors
deactivate View
@enduml
